{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ccb93643-398b-572c-a79c-4a74516771ed", "source_ordinal": 3108, "reading_ordinal": 944, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "底层出身", "published_at": "2021-08-30T01:07:16+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/26802920/answer/2091885751"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我怀疑这是因为这些人没接触过几个出身底层的人，或者根本不知道自己的朋友里面有哪几个是出身底层的——知道了怕是会吓一大跳。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "都知道朋友圈golf之王Martain挥杆有力，谁知道ta早年是砍甘蔗出身呢？", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这样想的人，更多的是出于一种对底层的想象。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "底层当然不是人人都是贫穷的圣徒的天堂，但是底层也根本不像这些人想象的那样就一定是全被动物性所支配。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "有好有坏，和中上流阶级的善恶构成相差并不显著。", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你可能以为我要给你个人口比例，但并非如此。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "并不存在“谁是善的、谁是恶的，然后两种人各占多少比例”这回事。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而是所有的人身上都混合着善恶两种因素——既有乐善好施、不求私利的一面，又有惊恐戒惧、贪得无厌的一面。", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 301}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "显著的差距并不存在于这种比例在这两种出身的人身上各占多少，而在于中上流社会的人吃相会好看一点。", "char_start": 302, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "吃相好看，很容易让没有这个观察力的人误以为ta们根本没有在吃。你的观察力要是不够，你会很容易把吃相好看误认为善良。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但唐僧真的很在意自己到底是被清蒸还是被串烤、配红酒还是配啤酒吗？", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "观察力不足，才是这些人喜欢说这些话的真正原因。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 464}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0155"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么有些人不喜欢出身底层的人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“底层出身”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我怀疑这是因为这些人没接触过几个出身底层的人，或者根本不知道自己的朋友里面有哪几个是出身底层的——知道了怕是会吓一大跳。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我怀疑这是因为这些人没接触过几个出身底层的人，或者根本不知道自己的朋友里面有哪几个是出身底层的——知道了怕是会吓一大跳。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7826192b-ff12-527c-a3b6-a2a4a7b27947", "source_ordinal": 3107, "reading_ordinal": 945, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "达尔文公园", "published_at": "2021-08-30T03:21:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/479557800/answer/2091962403"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "客观说，美国的社会架构对精英格外友好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "对loser来说，美国几乎是个达尔文地狱。但是对赢家们来说，美国却是一个可以提供其他国家难以提供的种种特权的特殊天堂。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在这里精英基本不受道德审判、几乎免于法律拘束。这些需求自有种种成熟的产业帮你服务。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "ta们在这里基本上是在决定，而不是被决定。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我说的不是精英们有特别大的违反法律的自由，而是ta们自有合法的途径获得ta们想要的东西。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "在这个地方，你有本事——比如篮球打得好、跑得飞快、代码写得好——你跃升阶层确实要比世界的其他地方更快。一旦你爬上去了，你会在事实上获得很多普通人够不到的自由。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这都不是虚言。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "问题是，这些东西会向你索取的也绝不轻省。不过在你拿到之前，你往往不会觉得这些代价有什么大不了，甚至搞不好还觉得不过是“甜蜜的负担”。", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 343}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所以，美国自然会是每一个觉得自己有几把刷子而又向往人上之人的无限空间的小朋友们的心之所向。", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "问题来了——世界上从来不缺少觉得自己是绝对精英、只是被该死的拖累和限制耽误了的人。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "（我发现很多人阅读理解很成问题——自认是被耽误了的精英的人，并不一定会是你眼里被公认的那种精英。）", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这样的人永远会继续存在，所以最大的达尔文乐园也就永远会被向往。哪个国家是最大的达尔文乐园，哪个国家就会继承这份永恒的向往。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 543}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这向往当然也不会在21世纪停止。", "char_start": 544, "char_end": 560}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "真正的悬念，是这最大的达尔文乐园会不会一直是美国。", "char_start": 561, "char_end": 586}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "ps：", "char_start": 587, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我可没说接班的会是中国——实际上出于文化原因，中国接班的概率不是很大。", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "印度的可能性不小。", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 636}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0155"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：美国天生的优势都有哪些？导致它能更大程度放任移民和自由主义？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“达尔文公园”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“客观说，美国的社会架构对精英格外友好。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "客观说，美国的社会架构对精英格外友好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f6a8864b-f8ca-5f77-80e7-1e5e88f21e38", "source_ordinal": 3106, "reading_ordinal": 946, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "忙工作", "published_at": "2021-08-30T15:51:25+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/438516757/answer/2092956311"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "咋说呢，很多人看不到。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "说起来也许你们会很意外——很多人其实是为了不回家而996，为数很是不少。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在家就要柴米油盐酱醋茶，要进行很多难堪的对话，要吵架、要安慰，要劝说。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "要热战、要冷战。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "要去开家长会，还要辅导写作业。", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "加班、努力工作、多赚钱养家、扮演一个辛苦到令人不忍指责的角色，已经是能找到的最不伤感情的逃避方法了。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 160}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "在工作里，老板、客户对你再不尊重，也没爹、妈、配偶、小兔崽子对你那么不尊重。", "char_start": 161, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "要不是亲生的，多少都打死了。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "说不通、打不得、躲不掉。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "也离不了。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "有996，少吵多少架，不给996了，那不得多在家陪着熬？", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "以前说要去拉萨的，全靠996挡着，现在岂不是真的要去了？", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "想想都发寒。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "：目", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 301}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0155"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：你觉得这辈子有希望看到996消失吗?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“忙工作”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“咋说呢，很多人看不到。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "咋说呢，很多人看不到。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e01cd2d8-42c9-527e-b0d5-15c893ca33cb", "source_ordinal": 3105, "reading_ordinal": 947, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "诛心", "published_at": "2021-08-30T22:18:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/27533590/answer/2093678449"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“诛心”，指的是根据自己的判断，排除掉“无心之失”、“另有苦衷”、“可能有误会”、“可能是比喻”、“可能是客观水平不足”等等等等一切可能，当众给别人的行为宣判一个罪恶的动机。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "注意，对方自己说“我就是想灭绝人类”，你来对别人“ta是想灭绝人类”，这不算诛心。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "对方自己没说，只是你自己观察了对方的某个言行，然后自己总结出一个结论说“这人就是想要毁灭人类”，这个就是诛心。", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这跟你猜对没猜对没有关系，往这个方向去猜这个行为本身就已经满足了诛心定性的所有条件了。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "注意，将对方行为定性为任何意义上的恶意行为的做法，都是诛心。", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "以下常用语全是典型的诛心——", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "避重就轻 / 偷换概念 / 蒙混过关 / 转移视线 / 顾左右而言他 / 你不是蠢，是坏 / 故意误导 / 假装不知道 / 故弄玄虚 / 虚张声势 / 抵赖 / 转进 / 东拉西扯 / 动机不纯 / 居心叵测 / 挂羊头卖狗肉 / 含沙射影 / 空穴来风 / 无中生有 / 含血喷人 / 指桑骂槐 / 夹带私货……", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "看清楚这个方向没有，【任何】哪怕【暗示】对方存在恶意动机的表达、任何尝试诱导第三方相信这个行为背后有恶性动机的行为，都构成诛心。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 498}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "简单一点说，只要你用贬义词直接指向对方这个人，指责对方个人正在【故意】这么做，你就是在诛心。", "char_start": 499, "char_end": 545}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "下面这话你记牢一点，记错了可能把命丢掉——", "char_start": 546, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "heading", "index": 11, "text": "诛心，在陌生人之间，就是宣战；", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 583}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "heading", "index": 12, "text": "在朋友之间，就是最直接的背叛。", "char_start": 584, "char_end": 599}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你可以觉得你是“开玩笑”，你可以觉得“这没什么大不了”，你想怎么觉得，是你的事。但是在社会实践层面上，你是不折不扣的在拿自己的判断力和社会信用在见证“对方是恶徒”这个指控。", "char_start": 601, "char_end": 687}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你这样做，客观的效果就是在策动任何对你的判断力和你的诚实有信心的人相信对方是一个邪恶的人。", "char_start": 688, "char_end": 733}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果这个还不叫敌意，那么敌意就失去意义了。", "char_start": 734, "char_end": 755}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你做了这事，再宣布“我就是开个玩笑”，意思是对方的名誉乃至生命财产安全对你还不如一个乐子重要，对方对你的定性甚至更坏——“对人没有基本的尊重意识”和“敢做不敢当”你至少占一样。", "char_start": 756, "char_end": 844}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "如果对方觉得你曾经受过ta的恩惠，你无预警的发动诛心——我这么说吧，对大多数人，敌人都要先放一边，也要先把你灭掉；对敌人都可以妥协、议和，对你也要追杀到天涯海角，斩尽杀绝。", "char_start": 845, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "为什么？因为你身为朋友，身为受惠人，你产生疑问不奇怪，但你问都不问，连是误会的可能性都不考虑，一路跳过“可能是误会”、“可能是笔误”，“可能是理解错了”、“可能是我不了解情况”……等等等等一千五百种可能性，直接就认定是这个曾经你自己也承认感激不尽的人是个恶棍，而且确信到你径直当众去做这个见证、去鼓吹这个观点的程度——", "char_start": 933, "char_end": 1092}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你自己摸摸自己的良心，换了是你自己，你对这样的人会是个什么看法？", "char_start": 1093, "char_end": 1125}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你对这样的人，你会怎么做？", "char_start": 1126, "char_end": 1139}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "然后再比着你自己的这个感受，去掂量对方对你的实际处置，和你自己对这样的人的处置比，到底够不够仁慈和公正。", "char_start": 1140, "char_end": 1192}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "诛心，就是这个级别的危险行为——十万伏高压电，谁摸谁死。", "char_start": 1194, "char_end": 1222}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "不是没有人能宽宏大量，原谅无知的诛心行为，这当然有。但这类人凤毛麟角，可遇而不可求。绝大多数人都是绝不能宽容和饶恕的。", "char_start": 1223, "char_end": 1282}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你要是拿这些凤毛麟角的反例要来跟我争“不见得有你说的这么严重”，那么只能说祝你好运。", "char_start": 1283, "char_end": 1325}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "还有一种极其错误的思想，觉得“为什么你可以，我就不可以”。", "char_start": 1326, "char_end": 1355}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "以为这是小孩子过家家，要排排坐分果果，人家分一个，自己也要分一个。", "char_start": 1356, "char_end": 1389}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "明了这个风险的人，做高度相似的动作，和你基于“你可以我为什么不可以”做出来的动作根本是两码子事，你自己没这个观察力看不出来而已。", "char_start": 1390, "char_end": 1454}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这就像架高压线的工人，你看ta就可以扯着线头跑来跑去，但你看不见人家戴了绝缘手套、看不见人家是怎么握持、看不到人家是怎么换手、看不见人家脚下踩的是什么。", "char_start": 1455, "char_end": 1531}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "人家看似也是在摸高压线，人家是几十年功夫练出来的绝缘操作。", "char_start": 1532, "char_end": 1561}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你喊句“凭啥你可以我不可以”，一摸就成社会新闻。", "char_start": 1562, "char_end": 1586}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你们干的不是一回事，而且这中间的差别也跟你难以解释。尤其是对梗着脖子“我就觉得没有区别”的你没得解释。", "char_start": 1587, "char_end": 1638}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "想听懂，先把“又想唬我”“故弄玄虚”这类鬼话丢掉你还算略有希望，不丢掉你连明白的希望都没有。", "char_start": 1639, "char_end": 1685}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你觉得“都一样”，你就摸吧。", "char_start": 1686, "char_end": 1700}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "莫谓言之不预也。", "char_start": 1701, "char_end": 1709}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "怎样才能做到「对事不对人」？\n为什么人们不喜欢被批评？", "char_start": 1710, "char_end": 1737}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37, "heading": 2}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 1710, "sample": "怎样才能做到「对事不对人」？\n为什么人们不喜欢被批评？"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0155"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：「诛心」这个词是什么意思？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“诛心”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““诛心”，指的是根据自己的判断，排除掉“无心之失”、“另有苦衷”、“可能有误会”、“可能是比喻”、“可能是客观水平不足”等等等等一切可能，当众给别人的行为宣判一个罪恶的动机。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“诛心”，指的是根据自己的判断，排除掉“无心之失”、“另有苦衷”、“可能有误会”、“可能是比喻”、“可能是客观水平不足”等等等等一切可能，当众给别人的行为宣判一个罪恶的动机。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e695de01-fda3-5344-9313-72c5131083cb", "source_ordinal": 3104, "reading_ordinal": 948, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "基督教国家", "published_at": "2021-08-30T23:30:02+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/20755959/answer/2093808410"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "会不会，这属于历史发展问题，不是人可以随便说会或者不会的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "没人能说一定会，也没人能说不可能。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但这里值得一说的，是这个情况并不需要担心。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "中国在意识形态上有一些祖传优势：", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "1）基数巨大。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "凭着在历史所有阶段都是最大人口规模这个几千年不变的固有属性，中国轻轻松松、自自然然就会成为全球最大宗。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "无论在哪个阵营，中国都会立刻成为该阵营最大的分支，一定是绝对主力。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "2）大一统传统。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "中国有一个天生的“一体化”的强烈的政治传统。几乎所有的意识形态分裂都是暂时的，最终的稳态总是一家独大的主流形态占到压倒多数，居于绝对统治地位。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这种大一统传统甚至到了这样一个地步，会尝试搞儒释道三教合一。", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "3）超强的“正统”构建能力。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "中国有一种行之千年、已经化为下意识本能的正统化的机制，会给一切东西都辨识、界定、推举出一个“正统”来。这个构造水平非常高，以至于常能靠特殊的严肃性、庄重性形成一个一看就让人敬畏和服膺的正统感来。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这三条合在一起是啥意思呢？", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "是假设有一天中国变成了“基督教国家”的话，恐怕基督教的最高中枢会被中国继承。会是中国教会决定其他教会谁是异端，是中国人为主的枢机团在决定教宗人选，是中国的主教会议在决定权威解释。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 509}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "神学的正统会移转到中国这边来。", "char_start": 510, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "不是中国要去忧虑别国利用宗教来渗透、颠覆中国，而是别国要忧虑中国利用宗教来渗透、颠覆别国。", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为中国教会会是一个十来亿人口的、没有内部分裂的、有充分正统感的巨型教会，以至于其他分支不能不围绕它运转。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 625}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "到时候谁比较怕还真说不好嘞。", "char_start": 626, "char_end": 640}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0155"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中国会成为基督教国家么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“基督教国家”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“会不会，这属于历史发展问题，不是人可以随便说会或者不会的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "会不会，这属于历史发展问题，不是人可以随便说会或者不会的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ac2d41bb-c9e6-5a3a-be3f-d7bc018cf19a", "source_ordinal": 3103, "reading_ordinal": 949, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "浮桥", "published_at": "2021-08-31T21:57:23+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/483168144/answer/2095682010"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 2}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "浮桥有几个问题：", "char_start": 3, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "第一，极易被顺流而下的漂浮物（比如火船、撞木）烧毁、撞毁、或者扯断。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "第二，极易被对岸拆毁烧毁。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "第三，会妨碍水路航运。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "战争时期，要么太容易被骚扰导致搭不起来，要么搭起来太难保护而太容易被人拆毁，导致被人“半渡而击”——尤其是一向都是北攻南守，水军优势总在守方，情况就更是如此。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "所以战争时期在长江黄河上架桥，必须是两岸都被控制了，要从北部调大兵团安然度江，实现高效的战略机动，去席卷尚未平定的两广、云贵、福建这些地区，这才临时这么搭一下。", "char_start": 153, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这时候这方案征用民船最少，而渡河效率最高。但这种属于临时使用，用完没多久就拆了，后人难以再看到了。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "和平时期的浮桥就不少了。", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你会发现一个规律——地名里有济、渡、津这三个字的地方往往会在历史上有古浮桥。", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "济、渡、津都是有常态性的跨河交通需求的地方，往往是长期摸索自然形成的有良好的成本收益平衡的渡河点。这种地方常常可以找到“古浮桥”这类景点。浮桥里面也往往带有“济”“津”“渡”字。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这其中最著名的是唐开元年间铸造的山西永济县铁牛。这东西用于在岸边固定蒲津渡浮桥的两头。（这座桥就是黄河浮桥）", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "又比如，广东潮州市有广济桥，就是一座浮桥。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "济南市，有十几座黄河浮桥。", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "福建建阳市（建水之阳），有东津浮桥。", "char_start": 518, "char_end": 536}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "江西赣州，有东津桥。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 547}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "浮桥还有一种特殊的形式，就是两岸往河心修，有一半结构——也就是水深比较浅的近岸段是永久的石质或者木质结构，只在某一段是浮桥结构。这样有通航需要的时候可以解开浮桥部分，放行航运船只。平时就搞跨河交通，隔三差五就规律性的放行航运船只。不想等放行期的船只，可以主动在这里直接交易货物然后掉头回去。", "char_start": 548, "char_end": 693}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "只是这些浮桥能垮长江黄河的不多，大多在支流上，而且在交通技术如此发达的现代，留到现在的也不多罢了。", "char_start": 694, "char_end": 743}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2021-08/31/70f5a20c13ae33c0949ed24757805b17.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0155"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：古代有横跨黄河长江的桥吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“浮桥”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 2, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1677f126-b725-51a2-9dc5-c4cad63f711b", "source_ordinal": 3102, "reading_ordinal": 950, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不准参赛", "published_at": "2021-09-01T12:00:07+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/482016001/answer/2096567425"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当年大英帝国日不落的时候，可是一点也没少往家里搞“殖民地风格”的东西。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "堂堂大不列颠本土，遍地都是印度风、非洲风、埃及风、日本风、中国风……", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "完全没有人讲过“这是异文化入侵”、“长此以往，国将不国”这种话。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "恐怕这种念头连闪都没闪过。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "什么瑜伽呀、冥想啊这些东西在美国流行得不行，人人头上挽个髻，“嗡”不离口，恨不得直飞喜马拉雅留学三年，回来当个金发印度人。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "说中国人喜欢cosplay日本动漫，去美国的漫展看看，也没咋好点。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "美国也没谁担心印度文化、日本文化侵蚀美国文化根基。", "char_start": 214, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "看出规律来了吗？", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "国力强盛了，实力成就证实了你自己的价值观有效了，这种心态就少了。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你搞个越南小吃一条街，鬼才会来担心中国年轻人越南化——哪怕越南跟中国关系不好也无所谓。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "搞泰国商品一条街，也没人会喊泰国化。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "之所以日本一条街有人喊，与其说是因为国仇家恨，不如说其实是因为对日本文化没有对泰国、越南文化的那种“根本不信你能翻起什么浪”的绝对自信。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 413}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "为什么没这自信？", "char_start": 414, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为自己对自己的文化心里没底。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "自己看着自己的文化，觉得自己的文化有各种各样重大的缺陷，自己找不到答案，甚至也不相信能有答案，所以担心其它表现优秀的文化的答案会说服“意志不如我坚定”的年轻人。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为反对者本人就是在靠“牢记仇恨”，“不忘立场”和“坚定的意志力”纯硬扛对方的“蛊惑性”。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 565}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "啥叫蛊惑性？那只是把异文化的合理性硬加上了一个反派污名，ta心底里其实是认同这个文化有让ta害怕的不能不承认的合理性的，不然ta怎么会这么担心别人被影响和说服呢？", "char_start": 566, "char_end": 647}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "问题是，这种问题可以靠“禁止接触”来解决吗？", "char_start": 648, "char_end": 670}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "那要靠自己建设自己的体系，在自己的体系里找到答案、就这个答案做出实际成绩、积累自己的东西来解决。", "char_start": 671, "char_end": 719}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "靠自己把自己的东西整理出真正受得起理论和实践双重考验的体系架构来解决。", "char_start": 720, "char_end": 755}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "举个例子——日本人解决忧虑，有日本的方式，中国有没有中国的方式？中国的方式比日本的方式优势在哪，劣势在哪？", "char_start": 756, "char_end": 809}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "日本人解决集体行动的效率问题有日本的方式，中国的方式是什么？优势在哪？劣势在哪？", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 850}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这些点点点滴，其实就是文化的本质。", "char_start": 851, "char_end": 868}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你都不需要比日本方式有压倒优势，只需要各有所长、势均力敌，中国方式就自然会因为路径依赖带来的额外优势而特别适合中国人，理性的力量自然会帮助你赢得这两种文化在中国人心中的征战。", "char_start": 869, "char_end": 956}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "问题是你为什么要怕日本方式会赢？", "char_start": 957, "char_end": 973}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "因为中国的方式是什么，你自己就迷茫。你自己就没答案。你自己就不赞同、不能接受别人告诉你的或者你自己观察到的答案。", "char_start": 974, "char_end": 1030}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "势均力敌，中国选手只要参赛，就会毫无疑问的赢。但如果中国的方式自己不成形，红方选手根本没有报名参赛，那么唯一不输的方式就自然是不给蓝方选手出场的机会了。", "char_start": 1031, "char_end": 1107}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "但是，已经126年了，你还如此焦虑的指望用不准蓝方选手报名的方式保证红方获胜，你不觉得你有点太依赖这个方法了吗？", "char_start": 1108, "char_end": 1164}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你是打算永远靠这招混下去吗？", "char_start": 1165, "char_end": 1179}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "有点出息，做好你自己的作业。", "char_start": 1180, "char_end": 1194}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0155"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待大连修建“盛唐•小京都”日式街？和苏州广东这种发达地区成熟的日本街相比有什么不足？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“不准参赛”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当年大英帝国日不落的时候，可是一点也没少往家里搞“殖民地风格”的东西。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当年大英帝国日不落的时候，可是一点也没少往家里搞“殖民地风格”的东西。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9d2ea40e-1a02-5a09-9d26-bcd7029d4af8", "source_ordinal": 3101, "reading_ordinal": 951, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "袁世凯", "published_at": "2021-09-01T14:59:22+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/320078369/answer/2096902785"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一个基本常识你要建立起来——在最终秩序这个层级上，“控制”其实一直都是个伪命题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "什么叫“最终秩序”？", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "每一种秩序，往往有一个其“底层秩序的有效性不容置疑”的前提。举个例子，公司的管理层得以控制员工的工作行为，这是因为法院、公安机关所维持的秩序作为公司秩序的底层，其有效性不容置疑。借着这个底层秩序的授权和干预，你不遵守，你会付出代价。", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "什么叫最终秩序？就是这一层秩序没有再下一层的无法抗拒的力量来保证了。", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "典型的例子就是北洋军这种。他们要是要抗命、要反叛，实际上无论是袁世凯还是清廷，都拿他们没办法。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 252}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "注意，是袁世凯也拿他们没办法，清廷也拿他们没办法。", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这有点像飞机失事，大家都掉在无名孤岛上了。你是不是我的老上级，现在已经不重要了。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 319}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "他们其实从根本上就不存在一个“必须要二选一绝对服从其中一个”的问题。", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 354}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "因为已经没有更底层的秩序能再约束他们了。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "清廷理论上可以用不发军饷、不发军粮、派钦差来撤职来要“控制”，但是借他们个胆试试？看看结果是北洋军因此涣散，还是几个省一夜变色？", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "袁世凯固然也没有什么“谁不听话就派出绝对忠诚的血滴子干掉谁”的神奇魔法——最终秩序没有“绝对可靠”可言。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "但是袁世凯有个最大的优势——帮清廷打赢和帮袁世凯打赢，后者的地位会弱势得多。", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "后者会更严重的依赖北洋军的老兄弟，更难“削藩”，更需要拿更高的地位、更大的权力、更多的利益来安抚稳定老兄弟们。", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "远比根深蒂固、盘根错节而且仍然手握大统、为列强所正式承认的清政府脆弱得多。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "至于列强，大家不是不想结交，奈何实在是一群军官，外交真的是一时学不来。", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "至于南方革命军，一嘴广普甚至南洋普，听都听不懂。看脸色就是要艰苦朴素扫荡罪恶的生瓜蛋子。正是最难打交道的油盐不进的阶段。", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "要选只能选袁大人。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 733}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "北洋军另一个选择，是撇开袁世凯，直接推翻清廷，自己当皇帝，但是有几大问题解决不了：", "char_start": 735, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "第一，清廷那是绝对结了死敌，也不必说了。", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 797}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "第二，很可能会把袁世凯推向清廷。", "char_start": 798, "char_end": 814}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "第三，清廷如果和袁世凯携手宣布北洋军为叛军，然后拼着再割半个省当租界、关税再抵押十年引列强直接出兵“协助平叛”，北洋军将极为被动。", "char_start": 815, "char_end": 880}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "第四，短时间内北洋军根本无法与革命军和解。", "char_start": 881, "char_end": 902}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "第五，扎根群众、立足人民和这全部的几方周旋……这提议只怕只会引起哄堂大笑。", "char_start": 903, "char_end": 940}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "走这条路，北洋军堪称四面树敌、自陷绝境。", "char_start": 941, "char_end": 961}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这都不是一群傻瓜蛋。", "char_start": 962, "char_end": 972}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "事实上，把袁世凯拱出来，是北洋军各派系要获得最大利益、最小风险、最低成本的最佳策略。", "char_start": 973, "char_end": 1015}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "事情根本不是他们“积威之下，不敢不听袁世凯的命令”。", "char_start": 1016, "char_end": 1042}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而是大家都摩拳擦掌、脸红心热要拉上袁公一起去纳斯达克敲钟。", "char_start": 1043, "char_end": 1072}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "生怕袁公不配合、闹情绪，把大家到嘴的鸭子吓飞了。", "char_start": 1073, "char_end": 1097}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "三弟愣头青乱搞，大家一定一哄而上把他揍一顿——耽误大家发财，罪不容恕。", "char_start": 1098, "char_end": 1133}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "袁世凯真正的优势根本不是对北洋军有积威、有恩情，或者捏着什么把柄命脉，而是他在那个历史节点上恰好是革命党、北洋军、清廷、列强都能接受的唯一人选。", "char_start": 1134, "char_end": 1206}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "换任何第二个人，都至少有一方不能接受。", "char_start": 1207, "char_end": 1226}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "没人想避开他、排除他，每一方都在呼唤他，大家只能比谁能争取他站在自己这边多一些。", "char_start": 1227, "char_end": 1267}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "清廷用优礼、加恩。", "char_start": 1268, "char_end": 1277}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "列强用站队、表态。", "char_start": 1278, "char_end": 1287}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "革命党直接用总统职位。", "char_start": 1288, "char_end": 1299}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "而北洋军阀当然是“老部下”，“孝顺”。", "char_start": 1300, "char_end": 1319}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "如此而已。", "char_start": 1320, "char_end": 1325}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 39}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0155"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：袁世凯下野之后究竟通过什么控制北洋军的？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038"], "summary": "围绕“袁世凯”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一个基本常识你要建立起来——在最终秩序这个层级上，“控制”其实一直都是个伪命题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一个基本常识你要建立起来——在最终秩序这个层级上，“控制”其实一直都是个伪命题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
